{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve organized the game content and Q&amp;A to help players quickly figure out if it\u2019s right for them! No need to waste everyone\u2019s time!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The English part of the fourth level has not yet been translated)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Composition</strong>: 70% stationary shooting &quot;horde-slaying&quot; + 30% absurd humor (The content contains a touch of &quot;hell jokes&quot; (i.e., dark humor with morbid or taboo undertones).).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Flow</strong>: A single round lasts about 5\u201320 minutes. Current total gameplay duration is approximately 2\u20133 hours (the game is not yet complete).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BGM</strong>: Mostly phonk-style music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Style</strong>: As shown in the image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC Performance Requirements</strong>: None! If your computer can run 4399 games, it\u2019ll basically run this without lag.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Roguelike Elements</strong>: Low replay value, as it\u2019s a linear level-based game.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u6211\u609f\u4e86\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3744910/ca977360c7c290d2f13be0a1bfe5bf27cb4c5572.jpg"},{"name":"\u7236\u7231\u5982\u5c71","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3744910/015a176a1d1168029efc2fe0e1f32aa5e77ccf93.jpg"},{"name":"\u51fb\u8d25boss\uff1a\u5bab\u672c\u732b\u85cf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3744910/30f874bb950b13809c8a0233da3d1a5b3cbc1f57.jpg"},{"name":"\u51fb\u8d25boss\uff1a\u57fa\u4f6c\u6cd5\u5e08","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3744910/6231103d46168b98ac7101148ca